From: Gaudi port <gaudi-port@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 14:03:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] patch 65: GLM53_EXPERT_DROP - physically drop experts on the
 HPU MoE path

Per-layer plan from the mask file: kept set, dense ids, rank r keeps the kept experts of its original slice
(contiguous dense range [start_r, start_r+n_r)). Registers the patch-64 expert-map override (dropped -> -1 so the
weights are never allocated), builds the fused op with (|K_L|, n_r, start_r, start_r+n_r-1), remaps routing ids
global -> dense after selection, keeps the patch-62 mask installed from the same file, keeps the patch-61 histogram
in global ids, fails loud on every mismatch. Zero effect when unset. CPU tests 9/9.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
